# #5238: the change is owed only to the silo that served the admin call, so
# every other silo keeps its cached setting with nothing on its way to evict it.
MODULE: CacheCurrentOrPendingAdminSiloOnly
TARGET: CacheCurrentOrPending
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a committed change is delivered to the admin's silo only
PERTURBS: Change

--- FIND
    /\ pending' = [t \in Silos |-> TRUE]
--- REPLACE
    /\ pending' = [t \in Silos |-> t = s]
--- END
